\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \Cref  {fig01} Represents a general influencer game set up. Starting from the left, resources are distributed in via a resource landscape $B(b)$. In this case resources are distributed in a two dimensional space with two traits. Players choose strategies $x_i$ in the strategy space $\mathbb  {D}$ represented as their positions. In the center the environment divides the resources in the resource landscape via relative influence \cref  {eq:SI_relative_influence}. The total resources distributed to a player is their utility function, which players use to optimize their strategy choice, represented as their movement in strategy space on the right.}}{4}{figure.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
